ily by dysregulating circadian rhythms, rather than through cognitive arousal or emotional distress.', 'perplexity': 1.294911688131078, 'mean_token_prob': 0.8420707796386855, 'corruption_type': 'motivation', 'min_prob': 0.05265354549610537, 'token_prob_slope': -0.003583326637652078, 'prob_variance': 0.06046488558447217, 'relevance': 'Auto-generated relevance here', 'max_window_entropy': 0.9030198993979515, 'avg_nll': 0.25844249833277494}

